### 1. API Gateway - Process Text Message (Sliding Window Pipeline - Port 8000)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/process-text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Hello, good morning.",
  "session_id": "live_session"
}

### 2. API Gateway - Process Second Message (Appends to Redis Window)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/process-text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Thank you for calling ABC Customer Support. How can I help you today?",
  "session_id": "live_session"
}

### 3. API Gateway - Reset Redis Sliding Window & History
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/reset-session
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "live_session"
}

### 4. API Gateway - Audio Processing (Port 8000)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/process-audio
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "audio_data": "UklGRiQAAABXQVZFZm10IBAAAAABAAEAQB8AAEAfAAABAAgAZGF0YQAAAAA=",
  "session_id": "live_session"
}

### 5. Whisper Speech-to-Text Service (Port 8001)
POST http://localhost:8001/transcribe/base64
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "audio_data": "UklGRiQAAABXQVZFZm10IBAAAAABAAEAQB8AAEAfAAABAAgAZGF0YQAAAAA="
}

### 6. Phrase Extraction Service - Direct (Port 8002)
POST http://localhost:8002/extract-phrases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transcript": "I need to cancel my account immediately due to billing issues."
}

### 7. Sentiment & Emotion Service - Single with History (Port 8003)
POST http://localhost:8003/analyze-sentiment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isolated_sentence": "Hello good morning. I need to cancel my account immediately.",
  "keyword_sentiment": "negative",
  "keyword_weight": 85.0,
  "history": [
    {
      "sentiment_category": "positive",
      "keyword_sentiment": "positive"
    }
  ]
}

### 8. Sentiment & Emotion Service - Batch Analysis (Port 8003)
POST http://localhost:8003/analyze-sentiment-batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "isolated_sentence": "Should you need a refund, we'll guide you through every step.",
      "keyword_sentiment": "negative",
      "keyword_weight": 80.0
    },
    {
      "isolated_sentence": "Thank you for being our valued customer.",
      "keyword_sentiment": "positive",
      "keyword_weight": 90.0
    }
  ]
}
